NOTICE — third-party material carried in this repository

Sting's known-format secret detector (engine/core/known_formats.py) transcribes
credential-shape patterns from the following open-source rulesets. Each
pattern's `source` field names the rule it was taken from. Nothing else of
these projects is included, and no third-party code runs on Sting's decision
path.

